      "body": "`HybridLinearAttnBackend._forward_metadata` reads\n`forward_batch.logical_forward_mode`, added by #34535. This test builds its ForwardBatch as a `SimpleNamespace` and never gained the field, so the whole file fails with:\n\n    AttributeError: 'types.SimpleNamespace' object has no attribute\n    'logical_forward_mode'\n\nThat fails `jit-kernel-unit-test-1-gpu-large` on main, and the PR health check treats it as a root cause and skips the rest of the run, so every open PR inherits the failure.\n\nThe property returns `_original_forward_mode` only when `prepare_mlp_sync_batch` has relabelled a decode batch as a 1-token extend. Nothing in this test does that, so the logical mode is the forward mode.\n\n`logical_forward_mode` is the only `forward_batch` attribute `_forward_metadata` has started reading since before #34535, so this is all the stub is missing.\n\n## Motivation\nIn case upstream failure after #34535:\n\n✗ FAILED:\n  /actions-runner/_work/sglang/sglang/test/registered/kernels/ops/attention/test_kda_prefill_graph.py (exit code 1)\n\nERROR: test_replays_match_eager (__main__.TestKDAPrefillGraph.test_replays_match_eager) (case=0)\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/actions-runner/_work/sglang/sglang/test/registered/kernels/ops/attention/test_kda_prefill_graph.py\", line 245, in test_replays_match_eager\n    self._check_replay(\n  File \"/actions-runner/_work/sglang/sglang/test/registered/kernels/ops/attention/test_kda_prefill_graph.py\", line 209, in _check_replay\n    ref_backend.init_forward_metadata(ref_batch)\n  File \"/actions-runner/_work/sglang/sglang/python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/linear/kda_backend.py\", line 720, in init_forward_metadata\n    super().init_forward_metadata(forward_batch)\n  File \"/actions-runner/_work/sglang/sglang/python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/hybrid_linear_attn_backend.py\", line 387, in init_forward_metadata\n    self.forward_metadata = self._forward_metadata(forward_batch)\n                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/actions-runner/_work/sglang/sglang/python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/hybrid_linear_attn_backend.py\", line 169, in _forward_metadata\n    logical_mode = forward_batch.logical_forward_mode\n                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: 'types.SimpleNamespace' object has no attribute 'logical_forward_mode'\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:no_entry_sign: [Run #39360257022](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39360257022)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39360256883](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39360256883)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:hourglass_flowing_sand: [Run #39360257220](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39360257220)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
